      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اصطلع</span></b> , accord. to Reiske, as stated by
Freytag, signifies <i>He,</i> or <i>it, was defiled,</i> or <i>polluted;</i> “ conspurcatus fuit: ” but he names no
authority.]

